  "title": "The Bike Basecamp",
  "date": "2023-06-16",
  "excerpt": "Mammoth Build Tier",
  "body": [
    "Welcome to the cyclist's dream van! This build, commissioned by our friends at Bike Barn AZ, is local bike shop approved and can accommodate a whole peloton of bicycles. We ventured into new territory with this project, crafting our first-ever build on an electric platform, the Ford eTransit.",
    "Bicycles can be stowed securely on the walls or floor, providing ample space for your two-wheeled companions. But that's not all. This van also features an air compressor, ready to top off your bike and van tires whenever needed.",
    "Built to sleep one and boasting a roomy rooftop deck plus an awning, this van is the full package. Fancy making some tweaks to this design? No problem, we're all ears and ready to make it your own!"
  ],
